        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: অনুমান করা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অনুমান করা — ônumān kôrā — \"to suppose; to infer\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমি অনুমান করলাম যে বাস দেরি করলে অরুণ ট্যাক্সি নেবে। āmi ônumān kôrlām je bās deri kôrle ôrun ṭæksi nebe. I guessed that if the bus was late, Arun would take a taxi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি ঠিক অনুমান করলেন, tini ṭhik ônumān kôrlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অনুমান করা (ônumān kôrā) is Sanskrit anumāna, inference (Monier-Williams), with করা: to reason from what you see to what you cannot."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
